 "paladinOaths": {
  "_source": "Each god's public Tenets post on the World of Arneyan wiki, its \"Paladin oath\" line, read 17 Nov 2026 by the Foundry chat for R-F49 (Lore L106; list in claude/BW1_Alignment_Kanka_Draft.md, Part D, plus the 11 that were already there). Flavour only: the Handbook's Code of Conduct leaves the vow to the player.",
  "oaths": {
   "Abadar": "keep one sworn contract or charter until its term ends.",
   "Akadi": "keep one road or sky-route open to all.",
   "Annam": "restore one lost piece of the giants' order.",
   "Asmodeus": "bind one soul to your service by contract.",
   "Auril": "spread winter's reign over one place that scorns it.",
   "Bahamut": "hunt one named evil until it is ended or redeemed.",
   "Bane": "bring one place under your rule.",
   "Bhaal": "mark one named victim for the Lord of Murder.",
   "Brigh": "protect one inventor, workshop or idea from those who'd destroy it.",
   "Chauntea": "feed one community through its hardest season.",
   "Corellon": "recover one lost work of elven hands, or guard one elven land.",
   "Cyric": "bring down one thing others believe in.",
   "Daeric Khyrmin": "perfect one form of the bladesong.",
   "Drake": "give your all for one cause you'd die for.",
   "Eilistraee": "lead one soul out of the dark.",
   "Eldath": "keep one place of peace where no blood is spilled.",
   "Grumbar": "raise or guard one thing meant to outlast you.",
   "Gruumsh": "bring down a named foe of the tribe.",
   "Helm": "name the one person or place you guard above all.",
   "Ilmater": "take on one other's suffering as your own.",
   "Istishia": "keep one water or harbour clean and its people safe.",
   "Kossuth": "burn away one named rot in the world.",
   "Lathander": "never abandon a cause while hope remains.",
   "Lliira": "free one person from what stifles their joy.",
   "Lolth": "bring down one rival above you.",
   "Maglubiyet": "win a battle for your war-band.",
   "Mask": "steal one thing thought impossible to take.",
   "Moradin": "defend one hold or clan as your own.",
   "Myrkul": "gather one great soul for the Lord of Bones.",
   "Mystra": "seal away one reckless or dangerous magic.",
   "Nocticula": "give one outcast the second chance the world denied them.",
   "Selûne": "guide one lost person or cursed soul home.",
   "Shar": "erase one memory, name or place from the world.",
   "Shune": "recover one forbidden text and keep it from the light.",
   "Silvanus": "defend one wild place from those who'd tame it.",
   "Sune": "guard one beautiful thing or person from harm.",
   "Tharizdun": "unmake one thing the gods made.",
   "Raven Queen": "hunt one undead or death-cheater until it rests.",
   "Tiamat": "win one hoard and lay it at the Queen's feet.",
   "Torm": "one sworn duty, kept until death or release.",
   "Tymora": "stake your life on one bold chance for another's sake.",
   "Tyr": "submit to judgement for your own crimes.",
   "Umberlee": "pay the sea a tithe from every prize you take.",
   "Zindel": "guard one place or people of Mournas."
  }
 }
}